@startuml
title Car Care - Service Center Login State Machine Diagram

[*] --> PortalChoice1

PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice2 : [Service Center Portal]
PortalChoice3 --> ServiceCenterRegistration : [New Service center]

state "Service Center Registration" as ServiceCenterRegistration
ServiceCenterRegistration : entry / Unregistered service center
ServiceCenterRegistration : do / Enter Valid Credentials
ServiceCenterRegistration : exit / Account registered

state "Service Center Verification"
ServiceCenterVerification : entry / Verify credentials
ServiceCenterVerification : do / Verify account
ServiceCenterVerification : exit / ServiceCenterRegistration or PortalChoice3

PortalChoice1 --> ServiceCenterVerification

state "Service Center Portal"
ServiceCenterPortal : entry / Logged in service center
ServiceCenterPortal : do / Show portal options
ServiceCenterPortal : exit / MainArea

MainArea : entry / In main area
MainArea : do / Perform actions
MainArea : exit / ServiceCenterPortal or Logout

PortalChoice3 --> MainArea

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / When user completes process
Logout : do / logout user
Logout : exit / [*]

ServiceCenterRegistration --> PortalChoice3
ServiceCenterVerification --> ServiceCenterPortal
MainArea --> Logout
@enduml
